From: tacryt-socryp <1377557+tacryt-socryp@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 20 Jul 2026 17:59:03 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 16/18] nockchain: connect Tip5 capacity outputs

Tip5 sponge state chaining can feed capacity limbs into later permutation inputs. The circuit AIR and preprocessor now carry WitnessChecks output columns for all 16 state limbs, while inactive/unreturned outputs remain zero-multiplicity. This prevents returned capacity witnesses from being read without a producer on the witness bus.

